### Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Null/Undefined skipping** | Ignores parameters with `null` or `undefined` values |
| **Array support** | Repeats the key for each array item (e.g., `tag=a&tag=b`) |
| **Encoding** | Automatically encodes special characters |
| **Relative paths** | Handles both absolute URLs and relative paths |
| **Existing params** | Lite version appends to existing query strings with `&` |

